@startuml F5.9-D06-criar-evento-calendario
title F5.9-D06 — Criar evento de calendário
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CalendarController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Salvar evento COLACAO
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /calendars/events
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: INSERT evento\n+ audit_log
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK (COMMIT)
Ctrl --> WebApp: 201 + cor
WebApp --> Sec: evento no dia

@enduml
